<title>JAPAN: Otsuka Kagu -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Otsuka Kagu -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.51		vs	   12.43</p>
<p> Operating	    1.58		vs	  238    million</p>
<p> Current		1.70		vs	  281    million</p>
<p> Net		  121    million    vs	   61    million</p>
<p> EPS		   11.21 yen	  vs	    5.72 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Otsuka Kagu Ltd is a leading retailer of furniture.</p>
